  "details": "Description\n\nAfter clicking on others to display detailed information and operating methods, as shown in the command prompt, I still couldn't eliminate the tutorial prompt, which greatly blocks the user interface. \n\nReproduction Steps\n\nFirst, the tutorial prompt pops up on the screen \"Tap someone to view more details and operation options, give it a try!\" \n\n1. I click on my friend's model next to me according to the instructions. \n\n2.The first information interface ran up and clicked on each operable option. \n\n3.Viewed my friend's profile card, and clicked any options.\n\n4.The tutorial prompts are still not gone, even if I try more other people's model character clicks. \n\nMay I cancel the tutorial prompt by myself? I have played on the computer and the Vr version, and I only recently encountered problems when operating the mobile version. \n\nDetails\n\n- Category: 用戶介面（UI）\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: AndroidMobile (platform: Android - Mobile, store: PlayStore, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: Android\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1886-676b60386c-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-08-22_14-23-19.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_7ba81c21-2ac0-4eb5-8aba-f656b765e602/1/file)",
